{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-kids-five-parts-famous-nba/audio/main-e61babeb954b.mp3","durationSec":268.512,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.6,"text":"Imagine your school team wins the final this year."},{"start":3.06,"end":5.54,"text":"Then it wins next year, and the year after that."},{"start":6.22,"end":8.42,"text":"Now imagine it wins eight years in a row."},{"start":9.28,"end":11.18,"text":"That really happened to the Boston Celtics."},{"start":12.1,"end":13.88,"text":"The Celtics started in 1946."},{"start":14.74,"end":16.9,"text":"They were one of the first eight teams in the NBA."},{"start":17.5,"end":22.16,"text":"Their name, the Celtics, comes from the Irish history of many families in Boston."},{"start":22.92,"end":25.16,"text":"Today they play at a building called TD Garden."},{"start":25.92,"end":28.9,"text":"The Celtics have won 18 NBA championships."},{"start":29.72,"end":33.3,"text":"A championship is the title for the best team at the end of a season."},{"start":34.12,"end":35.48,"text":"But look at when the titles came."},{"start":35.98,"end":40.46,"text":"From 1959 to 1966, the Celtics won every year."},{"start":41.52,"end":45.12,"text":"Then they won again in 1968 and 1969."},{"start":46.16,"end":49.74,"text":"Bill Russell played for the team and also coached it at the same time."},{"start":50.22,"end":54.76,"text":"So, many Celtics titles came close together, in about ten years."},{"start":54.76,"end":58.64,"text":"Their 18th title came much later, in 2024."},{"start":59.5,"end":64.68,"text":"Two years before that, in 2022, they played in the Finals but lost to the Warriors."},{"start":65.92,"end":67.54,"text":"The Celtics stayed in one city."},{"start":68.1,"end":68.92,"text":"The Lakers did not."},{"start":69.68,"end":71.56,"text":"Their story is also a story about travel."},{"start":72.04,"end":75.58,"text":"The team started in 1946 with a different name: the Detroit Gems."},{"start":76.32,"end":77.68,"text":"Later the team moved to Minneapolis."},{"start":78.28,"end":81.48,"text":"Then, in 1960, it moved again, to Los Angeles."},{"start":82,"end":83.72,"text":"So the Lakers have lived in three cities."},{"start":83.72,"end":86.76,"text":"The Lakers have 17 NBA championships."},{"start":87.54,"end":88.9,"text":"Only the Celtics have more."},{"start":89.66,"end":94.44,"text":"Because these two teams are so close in titles, their games against each other always feel important."},{"start":95.3,"end":97.32,"text":"One big moment came after 1979."},{"start":98.26,"end":101.48,"text":"That year, the Lakers chose a new young player, Magic Johnson."},{"start":102.1,"end":108.04,"text":"Later, the Lakers won a championship by beating the Celtics in Boston, in the Celtics' own city."},{"start":108.86,"end":111.84,"text":"For Lakers fans, that win meant more than a normal title."},{"start":111.84,"end":115.78,"text":"So the Lakers' 17 titles are not only a number."},{"start":116.44,"end":120.56,"text":"They belong to a team that changed cities and beat its biggest rival in Boston."},{"start":122,"end":125.78,"text":"The Chicago Bulls have fewer titles than the Celtics or the Lakers."},{"start":126.54,"end":128.56,"text":"But they won them in a very short time."},{"start":129.12,"end":134.06,"text":"The Bulls won six NBA championships between 1991 and 1998."},{"start":135.32,"end":140.08,"text":"First, they won three championships in a row, from 1991 to 1993."},{"start":140.66,"end":142.44,"text":"Then they stopped for a short time."},{"start":142.98,"end":147.94,"text":"After that, they won three championships in a row again, from 1996 to 1998."},{"start":148.84,"end":150.78,"text":"So the Bulls won three in a row two times."},{"start":151.36,"end":154.32,"text":"One shot helped finish the first group of three."},{"start":154.74,"end":158.58,"text":"In 1993, the Bulls played the Phoenix Suns in the Finals."},{"start":159.22,"end":163.7,"text":"In Game 6, John Paxson made a three-point shot, and the Bulls won the game."},{"start":164.34,"end":166.52,"text":"That shot gave them their third title in a row."},{"start":167.38,"end":169.12,"text":"So the Bulls show something new."},{"start":169.62,"end":172.16,"text":"A team does not need many titles to be special."},{"start":173.1,"end":177.54,"text":"Six titles in a short time, in two clear groups, makes a strong story too."},{"start":178.24,"end":180.64,"text":"The first three teams are often measured by titles."},{"start":181.34,"end":186.88,"text":"The Warriors also show another kind of strength: winning again and again inside one season."},{"start":187.52,"end":191.62,"text":"The Warriors are third in NBA championships, after the Lakers and the Celtics."},{"start":192.52,"end":196.64,"text":"They are also third in Finals games played, after the same two teams."},{"start":197.44,"end":204.42,"text":"Between 2015 and 2016, the Warriors started a season better than any NBA team before them."},{"start":204.82,"end":208.66,"text":"They also won game after game without losing, longer than any team before."},{"start":209.46,"end":210.6,"text":"These are NBA records."},{"start":211.5,"end":214.46,"text":"Stephen Curry and Klay Thompson played together near the back of the court."},{"start":215.08,"end":217.02,"text":"They helped make this time so strong."},{"start":217.58,"end":222.14,"text":"The Warriors also met the Celtics in the 2022 Finals, and the Warriors won."},{"start":222.86,"end":226.56,"text":"So the third team on the list beat the team with the most titles."},{"start":227.5,"end":229.08,"text":"Now let's put the four teams next to each other."},{"start":229.66,"end":230.58,"text":"First, count the titles."},{"start":231.18,"end":232.12,"text":"The Celtics have 18."},{"start":232.68,"end":233.8,"text":"The Lakers have 17."},{"start":234.34,"end":235.28,"text":"The Warriors are third."},{"start":235.72,"end":236.64,"text":"The Bulls have six."},{"start":237.42,"end":239.1,"text":"But now look at the shape of the wins."},{"start":239.82,"end":243,"text":"The Celtics won eight in a row in the 1960s."},{"start":243.4,"end":247.94,"text":"The Lakers won while moving from city to city, and they beat the Celtics in Boston."},{"start":248.68,"end":251.54,"text":"The Bulls won six titles in two groups of three."},{"start":252.08,"end":256.82,"text":"The Warriors broke records inside one season and beat the Celtics in 2022."},{"start":258.2,"end":260.74,"text":"So a number is like the score at the end of a game."},{"start":261.18,"end":263.76,"text":"It tells you who won, but not how they played."},{"start":264.6,"end":267.94,"text":"To understand a team, you need the number and the story together."}],"words":[{"text":"Imagine","start":0,"end":0.38},{"text":"your","start":0.38,"end":0.62},{"text":"school","start":0.62,"end":0.9},{"text":"team","start":0.9,"end":1.22},{"text":"wins","start":1.22,"end":1.48},{"text":"the","start":1.48,"end":1.7},{"text":"final","start":1.7,"end":2.04},{"text":"this","start":2.04,"end":2.28},{"text":"year","start":2.28,"end":2.6},{"text":"Then","start":3.06,"end":3.28},{"text":"it","start":3.28,"end":3.38},{"text":"wins","start":3.38,"end":3.54},{"text":"next","start":3.54,"end":3.82},{"text":"year","start":3.82,"end":4.16},{"text":"and","start":4.46,"end":4.64},{"text":"the","start":4.64,"end":4.76},{"text":"year","start":4.76,"end":4.92},{"text":"after","start":4.92,"end":5.18},{"text":"that","start":5.18,"end":5.54},{"text":"Now","start":6.22,"end":6.38},{"text":"imagine","start":6.38,"end":6.76},{"text":"it","start":6.76,"end":6.96},{"text":"wins","start":6.96,"end":7.3},{"text":"eight","start":7.3,"end":7.66},{"text":"years","start":7.66,"end":7.9},{"text":"in","start":7.9,"end":8.08},{"text":"a","start":8.08,"end":8.18},{"text":"row","start":8.18,"end":8.42},{"text":"That","start":9.28,"end":9.56},{"text":"really","start":9.56,"end":9.8},{"text":"happened","start":9.8,"end":10.24},{"text":"to","start":10.24,"e